@startuml
title HCP-D01 HikCentral Object Identity Mapping
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "VendorSystem\nconfigured HCP instance" as VS
component "HikCentral connector instance" as CI
component "HCP parking object\nParkingLotIndexCode" as PLIC
component "AdapterMapping" as Mapping
component "ExitPass Site\nreporting/vendor/POS boundary" as Site
component "Site Group\nlookup/payment scope" as SG
component "Site POS Server\nfiscal authority" as POS

SG --> Site : resolves to
Site --> Mapping : platform-to-vendor mapping
Mapping --> PLIC : vendor-side object reference
CI --> VS : configured for
CI --> PLIC : interacts with
Site --> POS : resolved Site fiscal routing

note right of PLIC
ParkingLotIndexCode is vendor-side identity only.
It is not ExitPass site_id.
end note
@enduml
